{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/1920x1080_20259RIVALS_Screenshot_EN01.png?t=1743129610\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/1920x1080_20259RIVALS_Screenshot_EN02.png?t=1743129610\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/1920x1080_20259RIVALS_Screenshot_EN04.png?t=1743129610\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/1920x1080_20259RIVALS_Screenshot_EN05.png?t=1743129610\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/1920x1080_20259RIVALS_Screenshot_EN06.png?t=1743129610\" />Enjoy an Officially Licensed MLB Baseball Game Anytime, Anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the fully integrated 2025 MLB schedule, and take on the World Series with 2025 Live Cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game chosen by 2-time National League MVP Bryce Harper, MLB RIVALS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25a0 MLB RIVALS Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[NEW]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># Moment Card: Easier development to become the core of your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># Lineup Synergy: Build your own dream team with a variety of cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># Ranked Tournaments: Find out who\u2019s the true champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[REAL]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># 2025 MLB season schedule, stadiums, and uniforms fully featured!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># 2025 Live Cards that reflect real-time performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># Realistic player motions captured with cutting-edge technology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># Relive the most thrilling moments with the Replay system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[PLAY]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># [Quick, Highlight, or Full Play]: Choose how you want to enjoy the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># Ranked Slugger: Become the true Home Run King!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># Live Match: Face off against rivals from around the world in real time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># Club Battle: Join forces with your Club members to challenge the top clubs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[EASY]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># No more complicated controls! Enjoy simple one-touch play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># Speed through games with Quick Play and play speed settings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"># Grow your players with ease! Improved Consecutive Upgrade feature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the thrill of baseball action in MLB RIVALS!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2569510?t=1743129610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743129610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/0d1b70f3038f73cff538cd1a9231936c9830ff70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743129610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/0d1b70f3038f73cff538cd1a9231936c9830ff70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743129610","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":